I found the precise infrastructure fault: this sandbox reports namespace PIDs from `getpid()` but mounts a host `/proc`, so Lean 4.22’s `/proc/<getpid>/exe` lookup fails; `/proc/self/exe` itself works. I’m applying a narrowly scoped runtime shim for the preflight subprocesses that makes `getpid()` return the host PID exposed by `/proc/self`, recording its source and checks, and leaving all frozen inputs untouched.
